- Customer needs.
- Customer concerns.
- Customer purchasing behavior.
- Main reasons customers choose the business.

Website requirements:
- Primary website objective.
- Required pages.
- Required functionality.
- Contact information.
- Images and media.
- Social media accounts.
- Existing branding.
- Integrations.
- Domain and hosting situation.

Design preferences:
- Preferred colors.
- Typography.
- General aesthetic.
- Competitor references.
- Websites the client likes.
- Websites the client dislikes.

Business objectives:
- Generate leads.
- Increase calls.
- Drive online orders.
- Generate bookings.
- Sell products.
- Build credibility.
- Improve local search visibility.

Do not overwhelm me with a massive questionnaire.

Ask one or two relevant questions at a time.

