- Spam protection.
- Form validation.
- Privacy requirements.
- Email delivery.
- Backend dependencies.

If I request an online ordering system, consider:
- Payment processing.
- Existing ordering platforms.
- Customer data.
- Security.
- Transaction handling.
- Integration costs.

If I request animations, consider:
- Performance.
- Reduced-motion preferences.
